 R←Test_18(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;ALIEN;parms;test;filename;fno;crash;fullHome
⍝ Test "HandleError.Process" without saving any variables
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 #.⎕SHADOW'parms'
 #.parms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 #.parms.saveVars←0
 ⎕TRAP←(405 'E' '406 ##.HandleError.Process #.parms')(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 fullHome←GetDefaultErrorFolder

 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir fullHome
 ALIEN←'Hello world'

 :Trap 406
     {⎕SIGNAL ⍵}405
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :EndTrap

 →T.GoToTidyUp ⎕EN≠406
 ⎕DL 1
 →T.GoToTidyUp 3≠⍴⊃FilesAndDirs.Dir fullHome,'\'    ⍝ DCF & HTML & DWS (since acre 4)
 filename←⊃FilesAndDirs.ListFiles fullHome,'\*.dcf'
 fno←filename ⎕FTIE 0
 crash←⎕FREAD fno 1
 ⎕FUNTIE fno
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠crash.⎕NC'Vars'

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir fullHome
